{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09702","headline":"送张献心充副使归河西杂句 · 岑参","name":"送张献心充副使归河西杂句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"将门子弟君独贤，一从受命常在边。\n未至三十已高位，腰间金印色赭然。\n前日承恩白虎殿，归来见者谁不羡。\n箧中赐衣十重余，案上军书十二卷。\n看君谋智若有神，爱君词句皆清新。\n澄湖万顷深见底，清冰一片光照人。\n云中昨夜使星动，西门驿楼出相送。\n玉瓶素蚁腊酒香，金鞭白马紫游缰。\n花门南，燕支北，张掖城头云正黑，送君一去天外忆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09702.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09702","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}